#. Plutonium subscription card text shown while a failed renewal payment is being retried. {graceDate} is a date already formatted and localized by code; never write a date into the translation.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/SubscriptionCard.tsx
msgid "Your renewal payment failed but <0/> stay active until <1>{graceDate}</1>. Update your payment method before then to keep your subscription."
msgstr "فشل دفع تجديد اشتراكك، لكن <0/> ستظل نشطة حتى <1>{graceDate}</1>. حدّث طريقة الدفع قبل ذلك التاريخ للاحتفاظ باشتراكك."

#. Report flow: note on the summary screen when sending the report failed for an unknown reason.
#: src/features/moderation/components/report_flow/ReportFlowCopy.ts
msgid "Your report didn't go through. Try again."
msgstr "لم يتم إرسال بلاغك. حاول مرة أخرى."

#. Video settings note shown when the saved screen share quality is above what this account can send. Resolutions are short labels such as 1440p or Source and rates are whole numbers. FPS is a technical token.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/UserVideoTab.tsx
msgid "Your saved {savedResolution} at {savedFrameRate} FPS needs {premiumProductName}, so shares use {resolution} at {frameRate} FPS."
msgstr "تحتاج جودة الشاشة المحفوظة لديك بدقة {savedResolution} بمعدل إطارات {savedFrameRate} إطارًا في الثانية إلى {premiumProductName}، لذا تستخدم المشاركات دقة {resolution} بمعدل إطارات {frameRate} إطارًا في الثانية."

#. Body of a modal shown when the video codec the browser negotiated for an active screen share is outside the codecs the app allows and no allowed codec could be published, which forces the share to stop.
#: src/features/voice/engine/v2/VoiceEngineV2AppScreenShareExecutionAdapter.tsx
msgctxt "screen-share"
msgid "Your screen share could not be published with a compatible video codec, so it was stopped. Try sharing again."
msgstr "تعذّر نشر مشاركة شاشتك باستخدام برنامج ترميز فيديو متوافق، لذا تم إيقافها. حاول المشاركة مرة أخرى."

#. Subtitle under the preview-paused overlay reassuring the user that the screen share is still live for others.
#: src/features/voice/components/voice_participant_tile/shared.ts
msgid "Your stream is still live"
msgstr "البث المباشر الخاص بك لا يزال نشطًا"

#. Heading of the subscription management panel on the Plutonium page.
#: src/features/premium/components/plutonium_page/PlutoniumPageMessages.ts
msgid "Your subscription"
msgstr "اشتراكك"

#. Toast error shown when the server refuses to move a Plutonium subscription down to the current price, whatever the reason.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription can't move to the new price right now."
msgstr "لا يمكن نقل اشتراكك إلى السعر الجديد في الوقت الحالي."

#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/SubscriptionCard.tsx
msgid "Your subscription ended but <0/> stay active until <1>{graceDate}</1>. Resubscribe before then to keep your subscriber history."
msgstr "انتهى اشتراكك، لكن <0/> ستظل نشطة حتى <1>{graceDate}</1>. أعد الاشتراك قبل ذلك التاريخ للاحتفاظ بسجل اشتراكك."

#. Nagbar body shown while a premium subscription is in its grace period. {premiumProductName} is the premium product name and {formattedGraceDate} is already localized.
#: src/features/app/components/layout/app_layout/nagbars/PremiumGracePeriodNagbar.tsx
msgid "Your subscription failed to renew, but you still have access to {premiumProductName} perks until {formattedGraceDate}. Take action now or you'll lose all perks."
msgstr "فشل تجديد اشتراكك، ولكن لا يزال بإمكانك الوصول إلى مزايا {premiumProductName} حتى {formattedGraceDate}. اتخذ إجراءً الآن وإلا ستفقد جميع المزايا."

#. Body text in the Plutonium subscription actions. Keep the tone plain and specific.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription has been reactivated."
msgstr "تمت إعادة تفعيل اشتراكك."

#. Toast success shown after a Plutonium subscription is set to cancel at the end of the billing period.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription has been set to cancel at the end of your billing period."
msgstr "تم تعيين اشتراكك للإلغاء في نهاية فترة الفوترة."

#. Toast success shown after a Plutonium subscription is switched from yearly to monthly billing.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription has been switched to monthly billing."
msgstr "تم تحويل اشتراكك إلى الفوترة الشهرية."

#. Toast success shown after a Plutonium subscription is switched from monthly to yearly billing.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription has been switched to yearly billing."
msgstr "تم تحويل اشتراكك إلى الفوترة السنوية."

#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/SubscriptionCard.tsx
msgid "Your subscription is active but perks are temporarily paused."
msgstr "اشتراكك نشط، ولكن المزايا متوقفة مؤقتًا."

#. Body of the error modal shown when a subscription is already scheduled to cancel.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/utils/PremiumActionErrorModal.tsx
msgid "Your subscription is already set to cancel at the end of your billing period."
msgstr "تم بالفعل تعيين اشتراكك للإلغاء في نهاية فترة الفوترة."

#. Body of the error modal shown when reactivation is attempted but the subscription is not cancelling.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/utils/PremiumActionErrorModal.tsx
msgid "Your subscription isn't set to cancel, so there's nothing to reactivate."
msgstr "اشتراكك ليس مُعدًا للإلغاء، لذا لا يوجد ما يمكن إعادة تفعيله."

#. Toast success shown after a Plutonium subscription is scheduled to move down to the current price. {effectiveDate} is the localized date the new price starts.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription moves to the new price on {effectiveDate}."
msgstr "سينتقل اشتراكك إلى السعر الجديد في {effectiveDate}."

#. Plutonium subscription card line shown to a subscriber on a legacy price whose subscription is already set to cancel. {cancelDate} is a date and {listPriceNewLabel} is a currency amount, both already formatted and localized by code; never write a date or an amount into the translation.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/SubscriptionCard.tsx
msgid "Your subscription still ends on <0>{cancelDate}</0>. The current price is now {listPriceNewLabel}. If you reactivate, you can switch to it from here."
msgstr "سينتهي اشتراكك في <0>{cancelDate}</0> كما هو مقرر. السعر الحالي الآن {listPriceNewLabel}. إذا أعدت التفعيل، يمكنك التبديل إليه من هنا."

#. Toast success shown after a Plutonium subscription is scheduled to switch to monthly billing.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription will switch to monthly billing at the next renewal."
msgstr "سيتحول اشتراكك إلى الفوترة الشهرية عند التجديد التالي."

#. Toast success shown after a Plutonium subscription is scheduled to switch to yearly billing.
#: src/features/app/components/dialogs/components/plutonium/hooks/useSubscriptionActions.ts
msgid "Your subscription will switch to yearly billing at the next renewal."
msgstr "سيتحول اشتراكك إلى الفوترة السنوية عند التجديد التالي."

#. Body of the error modal shown when a theme CSS exceeds the maximum shareable size.
#: src/features/theme/components/modals/ShareThemeModal.tsx
msgid "Your theme CSS is too large to share. Trim it down and try again."
msgstr "ملف CSS الخاص بالمظهر كبير جدًا بحيث لا يمكن مشاركته. قلّل حجمه وحاول مرة أخرى."

#. Success toast after removing a community vanity invite URL.
#: src/features/guild/components/modals/guild_tabs/GuildVanityURLTab.tsx
msgid "Your vanity URL has been removed."
msgstr "تمت إزالة عنوان URL المخصص."

#. Success toast after saving a community vanity invite URL. inviteEndpoint is the deployment invite URL base; vanitySlug is the custom invite slug.
#: src/features/guild/components/modals/guild_tabs/GuildVanityURLTab.tsx
msgid "Your vanity URL has been set to {inviteEndpoint}/{vanitySlug}"
msgstr "تم تعيين عنوان URL المخصص إلى {inviteEndpoint}/{vanitySlug}"

#. Body of a modal shown when the local video encoder produces no frames for an active screen share, which forces the share to stop.
#: src/features/voice/engine/v2/VoiceEngineV2AppScreenShareExecutionAdapter.tsx
